# AI Email Assistant

A fullstack Gmail assistant that uses the OpenAI API to generate professional replies to real emails from your Gmail inbox.

Built with:
- Next.js (App Router)
- Node.js + Express
- Google OAuth2 (Gmail API)
- OpenAI GPT API
---
## Features
- ✅ Google Sign-In
- ✅ Fetch Gmail inbox
- ✅ View + paginate real emails
- ✅ Generate professional GPT-based replies
- ✅ Send replies back via Gmail
---
## Getting Started

### 1. Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/client-email-assistant.git
cd client-email-assistant


Set up backend: 
cd backend
npm install

run backend: node app.js
backend runs on http://localhost:5000/auth/google/callback


Set up frontend:
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev
opens at http://localhost:3000


Improvements to be made: 
Gmail thread support (show full conversation)
Tone selector (friendly, professional, etc)

Make into a google chrome extension:
- Inject a generate reply button inside gmail UI
- Need a different backend host, prob Render
